# Local scratch and OS noise only.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored: plugins/*/vendor/.
#
# The Craft MCP runtime is ~14 MB because the default Context surface carries
# the TypeScript checker, and craft's own repository keeps dist/ out of Git, so
# there is no lighter upstream artifact to point at. A DSH `github:` install
# clones this repository and runs what it finds, so the runtime has to be here.
# The cost is one 14 MB commit per Craft release; the alternative — fetching at
# install time — fails on networks that reach GitHub only over SSH, which is
# how this repository was built in the first place.
#
# If that trade ever stops being worth it, the seam is
# plugins/craft-context/lib/mcp-client.js: bundlePath() is the only place the
# vendored file is resolved.

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
node_modules/
*.log
.scratch/
